## 8. Verification Checklist

Use this checklist after configuring the tunnel:

### Cloudflare

- [ ] `cloudflared` is running
- [ ] The tunnel is connected
- [ ] A public hostname is configured for production
- [ ] The hostname resolves over HTTPS

### Docker / n8n

- [ ] Container `n8n` is running
- [ ] Host port `5678` is published
- [ ] `WEBHOOK_URL` matches the public HTTPS URL
- [ ] n8n data volume is mounted correctly
- [ ] Local URL `http://localhost:5678` works

### OAuth

- [ ] Google OAuth client uses the exact Cloudflare callback URL
- [ ] n8n displays the same callback URL
- [ ] OAuth credential reconnect succeeds

### Webhooks

- [ ] Test webhook is activated
- [ ] External service can reach the public URL
- [ ] n8n receives the webhook request
- [ ] Workflow execution is visible in n8n

